<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξωνέομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>buy off, redeem,</i> c. gen. vel dat. pretii, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων τινὰς ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1352a13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήμασι τοὺς κινδύνους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					24.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτιμίας μείζοσι τιμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1315a24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				21.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρισχιλίων ἐ. παρὰ τῶν γονέων . . μὴ
					ἀπαχθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Peregr.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.18.4
			</span></i>; <i>redeem,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπαντα τὰ σφάλματα ἑνὶ ὕψει καὶ
					κατορθώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					36.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>buy</i> (in impf., <i>bid for,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.196
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐξωνούμενος</span> the
				<i>purchaser,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.66
			</span></i>; <i>bribe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.17.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
